"All right, just give me some time."
msgstr ""
"对战是吧？\n"
"好啊，给我一点时间。"

#: src/data/union_room.h:258 src/data/union_room.h:278
msgid ""
"You want to chat, huh?\n"
"Sure, just wait a little."
msgstr ""
"想聊天是吧？\n"
"好啊，稍等一下。"

