msgid ""
"A battle? Of course, but I need\n"
"time to get ready."
msgstr ""
"对战？当然可以，\n"
"不过我需要时间准备。"

#: src/data/union_room.h:261
msgid ""
"Did you want to chat?\n"
"Okay, but please wait a moment."
msgstr ""
"你想聊天吗？\n"
"好的，请稍等一下。"

