"Oh, sorry!\n"
"I just can't right this instant.\l"
"Let's chat another time.\p"
msgstr ""
"啊，抱歉！\n"
"我现在实在没空。\l"
"下次再聊吧。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:349
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm sorry.\n"
"I have too much to do right now.\l"
"Let's chat some other time.\p"
msgstr ""
"啊，对不起。\n"
"我现在有好多事要做。\l"
"改天再聊吧。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:357
msgid ""
"Whoa!\n"
"I can tell you're pretty tough!\p"
msgstr ""
"哇！\n"
"看得出来你很强！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:358
msgid ""
"You used that move?\n"
"That's good strategy!\p"
msgstr ""
"你用了那个招式？\n"
"真是好战术！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:359
msgid ""
"Way to go!\n"
"That was an eye-opener!\p"
msgstr ""
"干得好！\n"
"真让我大开眼界！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:360
msgid ""
"Oh! How could you use that\n"
"POKéMON in that situation?\p"
msgstr ""
"哦！在那种情况下\n"
"怎么会用那只宝可梦？\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:361
msgid ""
"That POKéMON…\n"
"It's been raised really well!\p"
msgstr ""
"那只宝可梦……\n"
"培育得真好！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:362
msgid ""
"That's it!\n"
"This is the right move now!\p"
msgstr ""
"就是这样！\n"
"现在就该用这个招式！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:363
msgid ""
"That's awesome!\n"
"You can battle that way?\p"
msgstr ""
"太厉害了！\n"
"还能这样对战啊？\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:364
msgid ""
"You have exquisite timing for\n"
"switching POKéMON!\p"
msgstr ""
"你换宝可梦的时机\n"
"把握得真好！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:381
msgid ""
"Oh, I see!\n"
"This is educational!\p"
msgstr ""
"原来如此！\n"
"真是长知识了！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:382
msgid ""
"Don't say anything funny anymore!\n"
"I'm sore from laughing!\p"
msgstr ""
"别再说好笑的话了！\n"
"我都笑得肚子疼了！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:383
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"Something like that happened.\p"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"还发生过那种事啊。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:384
msgid ""
"Hmhm… What?\n"
"So is this what you're saying?\p"
msgstr ""
"嗯嗯……什么？\n"
"你是说这样吗？\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:385
msgid ""
"Is that right?\n"
"I didn't know that.\p"
msgstr ""
"是这样吗？\n"
"我都不知道。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:386
msgid ""
"Ahaha!\n"
"What is that about?\p"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈！\n"
"那是怎么回事？\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:387
msgid ""
"Yes, that's exactly it!\n"
"That's what I meant.\p"
msgstr ""
"对，就是这样！\n"
"我就是这个意思。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:388
msgid ""
"In other words…\n"
"Yes! That's right!\p"
msgstr ""
"也就是说……\n"
"对！没错！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:405
msgid ""
"I'm just showing my TRAINER CARD\n"
"as my way of greeting.\p"
msgstr ""
"我只是出示训练家卡片\n"
"来打个招呼。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:406
msgid "I hope I get to know you better!\p"
msgstr "希望能和你更熟悉一些！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:407
msgid ""
"We're showing each other our\n"
"TRAINER CARDS to get acquainted.\p"
msgstr ""
"我们正在互相出示\n"
"训练家卡片来认识彼此。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:408
msgid ""
"Glad to meet you.\n"
"Please don't be a stranger!\p"
msgstr ""
"很高兴认识你。\n"
"以后常联系哦！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:421
msgid ""
"Yeahah!\n"
"I really wanted this POKéMON!\p"
msgstr ""
"耶！\n"
"我一直很想要这只宝可梦！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:422
msgid ""
"Finally, a trade got me that\n"
"POKéMON I'd wanted a long time.\p"
msgstr ""
"终于通过交换得到了\n"
"我想要很久的宝可梦。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:423
msgid "I'm trading POKéMON right now.\p"
msgstr "我正在交换宝可梦。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:424
msgid ""
"I finally got that POKéMON I\n"
"wanted in a trade!\p"
msgstr ""
"我终于通过交换\n"
"得到了想要的宝可梦！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:437
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} checked the\n"
"TRADING BOARD.\p"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}查看了\n"
"交换公告板。\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:438
msgid ""
"Welcome to the TRADING BOARD.\p"
"You may register your POKéMON\n"
"and offer it up for a trade.\p"
"Would you like to register one of\n"
"your POKéMON?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到交换公告板。\p"
"你可以在这里登记宝可梦，\n"
"提供给别人交换。\p"
"要登记你的\n"
"宝可梦吗？"

#: src/data/union_room.h:439
msgid ""
"This TRADING BOARD is used for\n"
"offering a POKéMON for a trade.\p"
"All you need to do is register a\n"
"POKéMON for a trade.\p"
"Another TRAINER may offer a party\n"
"POKéMON in return for the trade.\p"
"We hope you will register POKéMON\n"
"and trade them with many, many\l"
"other TRAINERS.\p"
"Would you like to register one of\n"
"your POKéMON?"
msgstr ""
"交换公告板是用来\n"
"提供宝可梦进行交换的。\p"
"你只需要登记一只\n"
"用来交换的宝可梦。\p"
"其他训练家可能会用\n"
"同行的宝可梦来交换。\p"
"希望你多多登记宝可梦，\n"
"和很多很多\l"
"其他训练家交换。\p"
"要登记你的\n"
"宝可梦吗？"

#: src/data/union_room.h:449
msgid ""
"We have registered your POKéMON for\n"
"trade on the TRADING BOARD.\p"
"Thank you for using this service!\p"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦已经登记在\n"
"交换公告板上了。\p"
"感谢你使用本服务！\p"

#: src/data/union_room.h:450
msgid ""
"Nobody has registered any POKéMON\n"
"for trade on the TRADING BOARD.\p"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"交换公告板上\n"
"还没有人登记宝可梦。\p"
"\n"

#: src/data/union_room.h:451
msgid ""
"Please choose the type of POKéMON\n"
"that you would like in the trade.\n"
msgstr ""
"请选择你想通过交换\n"
"得到的宝可梦的属性。\n"

#: src/data/union_room.h:452
msgid ""
"Which of your party POKéMON will\n"
